Omaread is modelled on Omawrite (https://github.com/omacom/omawrite).
src/systemtheme.h, src/systemtheme.cpp, src/cli.h, src/cli.cpp,
src/SearchIconButton.qml, the build scripts in bin/, parts of src/backend.cpp
and the matching in src/findhighlighter.cpp are adapted from it, under its
license:

Copyright (c) 2026 David Heinemeier Hansson

Released under the MIT License, with the same terms as above.

